    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44967" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spernax</span></b> , ācis, adj.
		sperno, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>despising</i>, <i>showing
